## 4. Structured Telemetry & Admin Security Alerts

```python
import structlog
from aiogram import Bot

logger = structlog.get_logger()

async def send_security_alert(bot: Bot, admin_chat_id: int, event_title: str, payload: dict):
    logger.warn("security_alert_dispatched", event=event_title, payload=payload)
    formatted_msg = (
        f"🚨 <b>SECURITY TELEMETRY ALERT</b>\n\n"
        f"<b>Event:</b> {event_title}\n"
        f"<b>Target:</b> <code>{payload.get('target', 'N/A')}</code>\n"
        f"<b>Origin:</b> <code>{payload.get('origin_ip', 'N/A')}</code>\n"
        f"<b>Timestamp:</b> <code>{payload.get('timestamp', 'N/A')}</code>"
    )
    await bot.send_message(chat_id=admin_chat_id, text=formatted_msg, parse_mode="HTML")
```
